{"id":"msg_m_ex_newflavor_04","cat":"messenger","group":{"id":"room_newflavor","label":"Temporary Briefing Room · Group"},"label":"4. Bready.","stage":null,"prev":"msg_m_ex_newflavor_03","next":null,"speakers":{"rapi":"Rapi","crust":"Crust","bready":"Bready"},"icons":{"rapi":"si_c010_00_s","crust":"si_c521_00_s","bready":"si_c520_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"msg_m_ex_newflavor_04_unlock","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"text":"Unlocks: Clear event stage 107320112 · After Temporary Briefing Room chat 3. Bonne Bouche.","key":null},{"id":"m_ex_newflavor_04_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newflavor_04_1","text":"Bready.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newflavor_04_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newflavor_04_2","text":"Crust.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newflavor_04_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newflavor_04_3","text":"Have either of you been in touch with the Commander?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newflavor_04_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newflavor_04_4","text":"Let me think...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newflavor_04_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newflavor_04_5","text":"Uhh...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newflavor_04_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newflavor_04_6","text":"Mr. Gourmand is probably with Bready.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newflavor_04_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newflavor_04_7","text":"Is something wrong?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newflavor_04_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newflavor_04_8","text":"Bready has been visiting him","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newflavor_04_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newflavor_04_9","text":"quite often lately.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newflavor_04_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newflavor_04_10","text":"Well...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newflavor_04_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newflavor_04_11","text":"From what I know,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newflavor_04_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newflavor_04_12","text":"she's been meeting up with him","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newflavor_04_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newflavor_04_13","text":"as often as she has","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newflavor_04_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newflavor_04_14","text":"because she and him need to discuss flavors.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newflavor_04_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newflavor_04_15","text":"Bready is an expert","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newflavor_04_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newflavor_04_16","text":"when it comes to flavors.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newflavor_04_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newflavor_04_17","text":"Why would she have to go to the Commander?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newflavor_04_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newflavor_04_18","text":"Er...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newflavor_04_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newflavor_04_19","text":"Well...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newflavor_04_20","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newflavor_04_20","text":"Because I have a rather peculiar palate, hehe.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newflavor_04_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newflavor_04_21","text":"There you are, Mr. Gourmand!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newflavor_04_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newflavor_04_22","text":"Yes, your tastes are rather unique, and you have a distinctive way of describing food.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newflavor_04_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newflavor_04_23","text":"That's why I call you Mr. Gourmand!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newflavor_04_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newflavor_04_24","text":"...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newflavor_04_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"bready","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newflavor_04_25","text":"You've been a great help,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newflavor_04_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"bready","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newflavor_04_26","text":"Bonne Bouche.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newflavor_04_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"bready","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newflavor_04_27","text":"I'm eternally grateful to you.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newflavor_04_28","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newflavor_04_28","text":"Glad to help.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newflavor_04_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newflavor_04_29","text":"...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newflavor_04_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newflavor_04_30","text":"I of course was aware that","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newflavor_04_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newflavor_04_31","text":"the Commander is a man of many talents,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newflavor_04_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newflavor_04_32","text":"but I had no idea his sense of taste was exceptional too.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newflavor_04_33","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newflavor_04_33","text":"Hehe...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newflavor_04_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newflavor_04_34","text":"Are you and Bready finished with your discussion?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newflavor_04_35","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newflavor_04_35","text":"Yeah, we just finished.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newflavor_04_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newflavor_04_36","text":"Okay.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newflavor_04_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newflavor_04_37","text":"Now that all of our work is complete, I don't think we'll be needing this chat group anymore.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newflavor_04_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newflavor_04_38","text":"I'll head out.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newflavor_04_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newflavor_04_39","text":"Oh, Commander.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newflavor_04_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newflavor_04_40","text":"I have a brief report I'd like to share with you, so I'll come pay you a visit.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newflavor_04_41","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newflavor_04_41","text":"Okay.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newflavor_04_42","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newflavor_04_42","text":"Rapi left the group chat.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newflavor_04_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newflavor_04_43","text":"All right then,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newflavor_04_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newflavor_04_44","text":"I suppose I'll leave too.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newflavor_04_45","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newflavor_04_45","text":"Crust left the group chat.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newflavor_04_46","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newflavor_04_46","text":"Should we leave the group as well, Bready?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newflavor_04_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"bready","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newflavor_04_47","text":"Yeah.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newflavor_04_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"bready","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newflavor_04_48","text":"But before that,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newflavor_04_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"bready","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newflavor_04_49","text":"I wanted to say how delicious you were today, Bonne Bouche.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newflavor_04_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"bready","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newflavor_04_50","text":"It was such a beautiful and enchanting experience.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newflavor_04_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"bready","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newflavor_04_51","text":"See you around.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newflavor_04_52","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newflavor_04_52","text":"See you.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newflavor_04_53","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newflavor_04_53","text":"Bready left the group chat.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newflavor_04_54","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newflavor_04_54","text":"Considering I'm the only one left,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newflavor_04_55","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newflavor_04_55","text":"I might as well keep this chat group around for posterity.","jump":null}],"chat":true}